# Cloudflare Pages redirects. See https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
# /profile.md → /cody-arnold.md (301): profile.md was an alias-by-duplicate-file. The
# robots.txt ProfileAlias line keeps advertising the URL; crawlers follow the 301 to
# the canonical content. Eliminates the byte-identical 5.5 KB duplicate on every deploy
# and the silent drift risk if one file is updated and the other isn't.
/profile.md /cody-arnold.md 301

